<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-14T21:51:02.179Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 21:51:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard is expanding its capabilities with a new station on Pag-asa Island and receiving modernization support from Japan, while the Philippine Navy, Coast Guard and United States Navy conducted a joint maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea. China has warned Taiwan that it will face consequences for using water cannons against a Chinese vessel, and Taiwan officials have reiterated that it must bear those consequences. The United States secured a foreign military sales contract for Coast Guard boats worth up to $12.2 million, and a mother in Binangonan is calling for justice after a boat disaster. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPenNJNGItSkUyTGZvWmpmMDI3dWxTQXBtS0ZZb3ROMTkxVUxONUhzazd6RXRaZVFKREpGWlB5bUNNS3QxbzJWQjFQN1l6VmtNNmlSZWt3c2tjUHgwbzJFVTZxWWlhNUZBTllEQW8xZHlGY3dqX2dKRFBoYkswelRBUnFJYmxxSXBKdTRpMWY0d1lGSW9n?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxONWFoVDlFZ2dyMEl5UktYaC1Pb0ZDUjJFSlZGS0tKUWMyUzhLLXozSGxDZ3otOXhTM0tpREVBUG95aEtJZ3RxZFpZeHM3X3UzUWx0WmE4SlVEWWtRMGlyeEU2ZlhjR2xCV0tRQ0hlQmx6bDBLVkNOREQwSjVLMHh3TmFzT1Y2M2I0NTgxX05QSjdDZjJfTDMtZFVfdGRMWEJxSjAyb01WVk90WV9qN09tTlJBRXE?oc=5&quot;&gt;RealClearDefense&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Demócrata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFBwQThMT280c1VrbXhENkY4SVh0bUpaUUd5elpweGJsZzBwTHlDc3E1WGt4RFd4Rkp3d29KNmhqU3E5em1TOV9hX1FYTFBGMm5aLTBZdTJxUWI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Center for International Maritime Security&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxOc25xXzcxS1FwR2Q2OT